WEBVTT

00:02.569 --> 00:09.466
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:10.742 --> 00:13.259
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:13.328 --> 00:17.466
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

00:17.535 --> 00:22.052
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:22.121 --> 00:24.466
- Hmm.
- 唔。

00:26.983 --> 00:30.294
Mmm!
[smacks lips]
嗯！
[咂嘴]

00:30.362 --> 00:34.087
- Hey, you've sampled
every flavor we have.
- 嘿，你已经采样了
我们有的每一种口味。

00:34.156 --> 00:36.949
Will you please just pick one?
请您只选一个好吗？

00:37.018 --> 00:39.190
- Mm-mmm!
Not so fast.
- 嗯嗯！
没那么快。

00:39.259 --> 00:43.431
I would now like to sample
combinations of flavors,
我现在想取样
口味的组合，

00:43.500 --> 00:46.845
and I would like you
to use my spoon!
我想要你
用我的勺子！

00:46.914 --> 00:48.845
[whistle blows]
[哨声响起]

00:48.914 --> 00:50.225
- Security.
- 安全。

00:50.294 --> 00:52.880
We have a sample mooch
at the counter.
我们有一个样本 mooch
在柜台。

00:52.949 --> 00:54.742
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

00:54.811 --> 00:55.949
[growls]
[咆哮]

00:56.018 --> 00:58.018
- Huh?
Ooh, ooh!
- 啊？
哦哦哦！

00:58.087 --> 01:01.018
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:03.569 --> 01:05.914
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:05.983 --> 01:08.397
- Hmm.
Hmm.
- 唔。
唔。

01:10.707 --> 01:12.190
- Wow.
- 哇。

01:12.259 --> 01:14.328
I can't believe
Goofy Goobers employees
我不敢相信
高飞古伯斯员工

01:14.397 --> 01:17.500
get to eat all the ice cream
they want on this job.
吃掉所有的冰淇淋
他们想要这份工作。

01:17.569 --> 01:18.914
- Hmm?
- 唔？

01:18.983 --> 01:22.638
- Yeah, but the rule is only
on the first break.
- 是的，但规则只是
在第一次休息时。

01:22.707 --> 01:24.294
And for lunch,
午餐时，

01:24.362 --> 01:26.121
and on the second break,
在第二次休息时，

01:26.190 --> 01:28.052
and for dinner.
和晚餐。

01:28.121 --> 01:33.018
- Wow!
Ice cream all day!
- 哇！
一整天都吃冰淇淋！

01:33.087 --> 01:35.190
[garbling]
[乱码]

01:35.259 --> 01:38.328
- Ice cream all day.
All day.
- 全天冰淇淋。
一整天。

01:38.397 --> 01:41.604
All day.
All day.
一整天。
一整天。

01:41.673 --> 01:44.190
- Ice cream all day?
- 一整天都吃冰淇淋吗？

01:44.259 --> 01:45.949
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

01:46.018 --> 01:50.776
I'm getting a job
at Goofy Goober!
我要找工作了
在高飞古伯！

01:50.845 --> 01:54.431
- Goofy Goobers and you.
- 高飞古伯斯和你。

01:54.500 --> 01:56.190
- Hello, and welcome!
- 您好，欢迎光临！

01:56.259 --> 01:57.983
As a new Goofy Goober employee,
作为 Goofy Goober 的新员工，

01:58.052 --> 02:01.535
we'd like you to know
that we appreciate you.
我们想让你知道
我们很感激你。

02:01.604 --> 02:04.156
The story of our ice cream
begins with our founder,
我们冰淇淋的故事
从我们的创始人开始，

02:04.225 --> 02:05.983
Reginald Goober.
雷金纳德·古伯.

02:06.052 --> 02:09.776
Who for some unexplained
reason was nicknamed Goofy.
谁为了一些无法解释的
原因是绰号“高飞”。

02:09.845 --> 02:13.949
In 1842, he headed West
in a covered ice cream wagon.
1842年，他西行
在有盖的冰淇淋车里。

02:14.018 --> 02:16.776
In the days before cones
and refrigeration,
在锥体之前的日子里
和冷藏，

02:16.845 --> 02:20.018
he served his warm ice cream
on rocks and sticks.
他端上热冰淇淋
在岩石和棍棒上。

02:20.087 --> 02:21.811
From those humble beginnings,
从那些卑微的开始，

02:21.880 --> 02:25.707
Goofy Goober has grown into
a multibillion dollar business
高飞古伯已经成长为
价值数十亿美元的生意

02:25.776 --> 02:27.776
that you,
our newest employee,
那个你，
我们最新的员工，

02:27.845 --> 02:29.949
now have the privilege
to work for.
现在有特权
为之工作。

02:30.018 --> 02:33.362
We only ask that you,
one, practice good hygiene,
我们只要求你，
一、保持良好的卫生习惯，

02:33.431 --> 02:36.362
two, maintain
good work habits,
二、维持
良好的工作习惯，

02:36.431 --> 02:38.811
and three,
believe in extraterrestrials.
和三个，
相信有外星人。

02:38.880 --> 02:41.294
[space music]
[太空音乐]

02:41.362 --> 02:45.052
- Peace, hugs,
and ice cream!
- 和平，拥抱，
还有冰淇淋！

02:45.121 --> 02:48.225
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:48.294 --> 02:49.707
- Ha-ha!
The end.
- 哈哈！
结束。

02:49.776 --> 02:53.259
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

02:53.328 --> 02:55.914
- Hello, Goofy newbie.
- 你好，高飞新手。

02:55.983 --> 02:58.052
- [yells, pants]
- [喊叫，裤子]

02:58.121 --> 03:00.190
Can I have ice cream now?
我现在可以吃冰淇淋吗？

03:00.259 --> 03:02.845
- Not until your first break.
[chuckles]
- 直到你第一次休息。
[笑声]

03:02.914 --> 03:04.604
I'm your manager,
我是你的经理

03:04.673 --> 03:08.535
and I want you to know
that I appreciate you.
我想让你知道
我很欣赏你。

03:08.604 --> 03:12.500
Now let's get you started.
- [hums]
现在让我们开始吧。
- [哼哼]

03:12.569 --> 03:15.190
- You will be washing
dishes today.
- 你会洗
今天的菜。

03:15.259 --> 03:17.225
What do you think of that?
你对此有何看法？

03:17.294 --> 03:19.087
- Oh, I had a thought once.
- 哦，我曾经有过一个想法。

03:19.156 --> 03:21.604
[radio transmitter warbles]
[无线电发射机的颤音]

03:21.673 --> 03:23.190
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

03:23.259 --> 03:26.638
Ooh, you sure put
the Goofy in Goober!
哦，你确实放了
古伯里的高飞！

03:26.707 --> 03:29.604
I'll check on you
in a few minutes.
我会检查你的情况
几分钟后。

03:29.673 --> 03:31.569
- Huh?
- 啊？

03:31.638 --> 03:34.156
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

03:34.225 --> 03:36.362
Ooh!
哦！

03:38.156 --> 03:40.776
- [chuckles, gasps]
- [轻笑，喘气]

03:40.845 --> 03:42.328
[chuckles]
[笑声]

03:42.397 --> 03:45.156
[bottle squeaks]
[瓶子吱吱声]

03:45.225 --> 03:46.845
Exceptional!
太棒了！

03:46.914 --> 03:49.880
Show me how you cleaned
all these dishes so fast.
告诉我你是如何清洁的
所有这些菜都这么快。

03:49.949 --> 03:51.742
- Okay!
- 好的！

03:51.811 --> 03:53.949
[moans]
[呻吟声]

03:58.949 --> 04:02.535
- Never tell anyone
you did that.
- 永远不要告诉任何人
你这么做了。

04:02.604 --> 04:05.914
- Is it time
for my first break?
- 时间到了吗
我的第一次休息？

04:05.983 --> 04:07.087
- Not yet.
- 还没有。

04:07.156 --> 04:10.949
- Aww!
- 哇！

04:11.018 --> 04:13.742
- This should be easy.
[clears throat]
- 这应该很容易。
[清嗓子]

04:13.811 --> 04:17.466
Just unload the boxes
of ice cream from the truck,
只需卸下箱子
从卡车上运来的冰淇淋，

04:17.535 --> 04:20.742
and stack them
in the freezer.
并将它们堆叠起来
在冰箱里。

04:20.811 --> 04:23.707
Okay, repeat it
back to me.
好的，重复一遍
回到我身边。

04:23.776 --> 04:25.673
- [shakily]
When the bell rings,
- [颤抖]
当铃声响起时，

04:25.742 --> 04:27.811
I peel a banana
and run like the devil.
我剥一个香蕉
像魔鬼一样奔跑。

04:27.880 --> 04:31.673
- Uh.
Eh, close enough.
- 呃。
呃，够接近了。

04:33.431 --> 04:36.190
Ooh, good, good!
哦哦，好啊好啊！

04:36.259 --> 04:38.569
The truck is empty.
卡车是空的。

04:40.052 --> 04:42.983
[yelps]
That's hot!
[尖叫声]
太热了！

04:43.052 --> 04:45.776
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

04:47.052 --> 04:51.397
[crowd yelling]
[人群喊叫]

04:51.466 --> 04:53.914
- Nothing's biting today.
- 今天没什么事。

04:53.983 --> 04:57.604
- Newbie, why would you turn
the heat on in the freezer?
- 新手，你为什么要转身
冰箱里的暖气开着吗？

04:57.673 --> 04:59.742
- Oh, it was
freezing in there,
- 哦，原来是
冻结在那里，

04:59.811 --> 05:02.362
and the fire I built
wasn't doing it.
和我生的火
没有这样做。

05:02.431 --> 05:04.742
- What?
- 什么？

05:06.673 --> 05:09.362
Now, this should
be easy for you.
现在，这应该
对你来说很容易。

05:09.431 --> 05:12.087
You just walk around
as Goofy the Goober
你只是四处走走
饰演 Goofy the Goober

05:12.156 --> 05:13.707
and wave to the kids.
并向孩子们挥手致意。

05:13.776 --> 05:15.087
But a warning--
但警告——

05:15.156 --> 05:18.742
Sometimes the kids
get a little over-affectionate.
有时孩子们
变得有点过于深情。

05:20.225 --> 05:21.535
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

05:21.604 --> 05:23.431
- [whimpering]
- [babbling]
- [呜咽]
- [胡言乱语]

05:23.500 --> 05:26.294
I love you, Goofy Goober!
我爱你，高飞古伯！

05:26.362 --> 05:28.397
- [laughs]
So cute.
- [笑]
太可爱了。

05:28.466 --> 05:30.535
Good luck!
祝你好运！

05:30.604 --> 05:32.397
- I want you
to be my daddy!
- 我想要你
做我的爸爸！

05:32.466 --> 05:36.018
- [grunting]
I want to crack this nut!
- [咕哝]
我想敲碎这个坚果！

05:36.087 --> 05:37.397
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

05:37.466 --> 05:40.466
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

05:40.535 --> 05:43.018
- Sorry.
- [laughs]
- 对不起。
- [笑]

05:43.087 --> 05:45.431
Yay!
耶！

05:45.500 --> 05:48.880
[laughter and chatter]
[笑声和闲聊]

05:48.949 --> 05:52.880
- Oh.
Unattended ice cream.
- 哦。
无人看管的冰淇淋。

05:55.811 --> 05:58.535
Mustn't let it
go to waste.
一定不能让
浪费掉。

05:58.604 --> 06:00.880
[vacuum whirring]
[真空呼呼]

06:00.949 --> 06:02.845
[laughs]
[笑]

06:02.914 --> 06:04.949
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

06:05.018 --> 06:07.845
Hmph.
哼。

06:07.914 --> 06:09.914
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:09.983 --> 06:12.914
I think you better
go home and clean up.
我觉得你更好
回家清理一下。

06:12.983 --> 06:17.121
- But I haven't had
my first ice cream break!
- 但我还没有
我的第一次冰淇淋休息！

06:17.190 --> 06:19.673
- I'll give you
another chance tomorrow.
- 我给你
明天还有机会。

06:19.742 --> 06:23.121
If it doesn't work out,
I'm afraid you're fired...
如果没能解决的话
我担心你会被解雇...

06:23.190 --> 06:26.397
[clears throat]
in a most appreciative way.
[清嗓子]
以最欣赏的方式。

06:26.466 --> 06:30.983
[flute playing]
[长笛演奏]

06:31.052 --> 06:36.397
- Oh, sorry, mister.
I thought this was my rock.
- 哦，对不起，先生。
我以为这是我的石头。

06:36.466 --> 06:38.776
- [laughs]
Patrick, this is your rock.
- [笑]
帕特里克，这是你的石头。

06:38.845 --> 06:42.018
I was waiting for you.
How was your first day at work?
我在等你。
你第一天上班怎么样？

06:42.087 --> 06:45.914
- Oh, I can't
do anything right.
- 哦，我不能
做正确的事。

06:45.983 --> 06:49.845
I'll probably
get fired tomorrow.
我大概会
明天就被解雇。

06:49.914 --> 06:52.121
- Oh, you poor little sea star.
- 哦，你可怜的小海星。

06:52.190 --> 06:54.362
- Tell you what, buddy--
Tomorrow, I'll come
-告诉你什么，伙计--
明天我来

06:54.431 --> 06:55.845
with you to work
and help out.
和你一起工作
并提供帮助。

06:55.914 --> 06:58.811
- Oh, thanks,
kind stranger!
-哦，谢谢，
好心的陌生人！

07:00.500 --> 07:03.156
Okay, tell me
for the gajillionth time,
好吧，告诉我
第无数次，

07:03.225 --> 07:05.018
how is this
gonna work?
这是怎么回事
会工作吗？

07:05.087 --> 07:07.845
- I'll show you.
[both grunting]
- 我会告诉你。
[两人都咕哝着]

07:07.914 --> 07:09.604
If you put your arms
behind you,
如果你放开双臂
在你身后，

07:09.673 --> 07:11.707
I can be your hands.
我可以成为你的双手。

07:11.776 --> 07:15.707
- Ooh, so when
I scoop ice cream--
- 哦，那么什么时候
我舀冰淇淋——

07:15.776 --> 07:18.880
- I'll do the scoopin'.
- And when I give change--
- 我来挖勺。
- 当我找零时--

07:18.949 --> 07:21.431
- I'll do the countin'.
- And when my butt itches--
- 我来数数。
- 当我屁股痒的时候--

07:21.500 --> 07:24.535
- Yeah, I'm not doing that.
- 是的，我不会那样做。

07:24.604 --> 07:29.466
- Okay, ready for your second,
and last chance?
- 好的，准备好第二次了
最后一次机会？

07:29.535 --> 07:31.707
[grunts inquisitively]
[好奇地咕哝]

07:34.500 --> 07:37.156
[chuckles]
Let me show you how to make--
[笑声]
让我向您展示如何制作——

07:37.225 --> 07:39.121
- Ice cream sandwiches?
- 冰淇淋三明治？

07:39.190 --> 07:41.259
I think I got this.
我想我明白了。

07:43.156 --> 07:44.914
- Ooh.
- 哦。

07:44.983 --> 07:46.914
- Time for my first break?
- Oh, no, no, no.
- 我第一次休息的时间到了吗？
- 哦，不，不，不。

07:46.983 --> 07:48.811
Not yet, not yet.
[chuckles]
还没有，还没有。
[笑声]

07:48.880 --> 07:51.569
But I think you're ready
for the big time.
但我想你已经准备好了
很重要的时候。

07:53.190 --> 07:55.707
- All right, kid.
Relax, don't choke,
- 好吧，孩子。
放松点，别噎着

07:55.776 --> 07:57.880
and try to have fun.
并尝试玩得开心。

07:57.949 --> 08:00.638
- Easy, queasy,
lemon sneezy.
- 容易，恶心，
柠檬打喷嚏。

08:00.707 --> 08:04.121
- [rhythmic vocalizing]
- [有节奏的发声]

08:04.190 --> 08:06.225
Ta-da!
哒哒！

08:06.294 --> 08:09.431
- Work is hard work.
[snores]
- 工作是艰苦的工作。
[打鼾]

08:09.500 --> 08:11.431
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

08:11.500 --> 08:14.500
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

08:15.466 --> 08:17.569
[laughing]
[笑]

08:19.880 --> 08:22.052
Hello, folks!
I'm Edible Ed!
哈喽，各位！
我是吃货艾德！

08:22.121 --> 08:26.294
Start with my head!
[laughter and cheers]
从我的头开始吧！
[笑声和欢呼声]

08:26.362 --> 08:28.500
[bicycle horn honking]
[自行车喇叭鸣响]

08:28.569 --> 08:30.949
- [laughs]
Great job, newbie.
- [笑]
干得好，新手。

08:31.018 --> 08:33.569
Now you can take
your first break.
现在你可以采取
你的第一次休息。

08:33.638 --> 08:36.087
- My break?
I can eat ice cream now?
- 我的休息时间？
我现在可以吃冰淇淋吗？

08:36.156 --> 08:38.500
- All you can handle.
- 一切你能处理的。

08:38.569 --> 08:41.535
- [whimpering excitedly]
- [兴奋地呜咽]

08:41.604 --> 08:44.535
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

08:46.500 --> 08:49.018
- Thanks for your help, buddy.
- 谢谢你的帮助，伙计。

08:49.087 --> 08:52.845
Now, let's dig in.
现在，让我们深入探讨一下。

08:52.914 --> 08:56.087
- Oh, I'd love to.
[watch beeping]
- 哦，我很乐意。
[注意蜂鸣声]

08:56.156 --> 08:58.535
But if I don't hurry,
I'll be late for my job.
但如果我不快点的话
我上班会迟到的。

08:58.604 --> 09:00.604
Sure you can handle
that ice cream all...
当然你可以处理
那个冰淇淋全...

09:00.673 --> 09:02.431
- [slurping]
- By yourself?
- [发出声音]
- 自己一个人吗？

09:02.500 --> 09:04.604
- [excited grumbling]
- [兴奋的抱怨]

09:04.673 --> 09:06.225
- Silly question.
- 愚蠢的问题。

09:06.294 --> 09:08.500
- [excited grumbling]
- [兴奋的抱怨]

09:08.569 --> 09:10.742
[burps]
[打嗝]

09:10.811 --> 09:13.052
- Good luck,
my employed pal.
- 祝你好运，
我的雇佣朋友。

09:13.121 --> 09:14.776
[cuckoo clock tones]
[布谷鸟钟声]

09:14.845 --> 09:17.983
- Oh! Only two more minutes
for my break!
- 哦！只剩下两分钟了
为了我的休息！

09:18.052 --> 09:20.156
And two more minutes
for ice cream!
还有两分钟
为了冰淇淋！

09:20.225 --> 09:22.225
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

09:22.294 --> 09:26.914
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:26.983 --> 09:31.052
- [yells]
- [大喊]

09:31.121 --> 09:33.811
all: [chanting]
Chug, chug, chug, chug!
全体：[吟诵]
嘎嘎，嘎嘎，嘎嘎，嘎嘎！

09:33.880 --> 09:38.535
- [muffled grunting]
- [低沉的咕哝声]

09:38.604 --> 09:42.052
[slurping]
[发出声音]

09:45.018 --> 09:47.466
